.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH tine-prop 1  "prop " 
.SH NAME
tine\-prop \- Set or remove one property of a block
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtine prop\fR [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Set or remove one property of a block
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Enable diagnostic logging for the desktop app
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
tine\-prop\-set(1)
Set KEY to VALUE on the block
.TP
tine\-prop\-remove(1)
Remove KEY from the block
